    <string name="mirage_tank_help_p1">[What is Mirage Tank?] By controlling PNG Alpha transparency, a single picture renders distinct visuals when blended against light (white) vs. dark (black) background platforms.</string>
    <string name="mirage_tank_help_p2">[Selection Tips] Front image is recommended to be clean, line-defined or light-toned; Back image is recommended to be deeper or dark-toned. Greater contrast yields superior disguise.</string>
    <string name="mirage_tank_help_p3">[Tuning Tips] If the front image bleeds into dark backgrounds, increase front lightness or lower back lightness. Enable Checkerboard Blending in color mode for better color fidelity.</string>

