    <string name="decision_help_title">How it works</string>
    <string name="decision_help_p1">Wheel: each slice is sized by its weight. Tap the hub to spin, and the slice the pointer lands on gets outlined. No dialog pops up.</string>
    <string name="decision_help_p2">Sticks: shake your phone or drag on the tube to build up shake energy. When the gauge is full, the center stick slides up out of the aperture and shows your answer face up, so no dialog is needed.</string>
    <string name="decision_help_p3">Another round: tap the hub again on the wheel, or keep shaking the tube — the previous stick is put back automatically.</string>
    <string name="decision_help_p4">Topics can be created, edited and deleted, weights are adjustable from 1 to 10, options can be pasted in bulk, and everything can be exported or imported as JSON.</string>

